Subject: [PATCH 09/40] docs: state the hypotheses and the model level of the
 proved guarantees

README theorem table omitted DocWF (decode_encode/encode_injective are false without
it, see audit/proofs/Counterexamples.lean CE3) and presented model-level (J/Obj)
theorems as text-level guarantees (check_roundtrip, decSnapshot_encSnapshot,
handle_step, reply_readable). reply_readable covers only 'step', not start/restart.
Decision 7 (timer token) is enforced by Engine.decEvent only; in the Core model a
named 'timer:x' event bypasses the token (CE2).

(cherry picked from commit d9934d57b935484e0d2f1e9a8b2ece1e453a6d93)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
